dialogue prologue_tithe
title: The Hamlet of Tithe
trigger: Prologue Tithe
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker knight knight
speaker cleric cleric
speaker merchant - name=Merchant portrait=courier

node arrive commander
  A dozen turf roofs around a well, and every door shut. Grey paint on every wall where the colour used to be.
  -> monthly

node monthly knight
  The Captain's Tithe Collector takes the colour every month now. Paint, cloth, flowers, anything bright. He says the Choir needs it.
  -> bridge

node bridge cleric
  He's holding a Red Mage at the toll bridge. She wouldn't pay, and he wants the whole hamlet to see what that costs.
  -> merchant

node merchant merchant
  If you're going to that bridge, I've one Healing Potion left. Take it. I'd rather it went your way than his.
  -> plan

node plan knight
  One potion. Give it to whoever stands in front. That's me.
